# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
# One properties file per brand: key.properties is Sabily's (historical name),
# <flavor>-key.properties is every other brand's. The trailing * catches the
# .pending suffix a brand's credentials sit behind until its key goes live.
key.properties*
*-key.properties*
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
# An upload certificate is public, but it is an artefact of a key ceremony and
# belongs with the keystore, not in the history.
**/*-upload-cert.pem
